@startuml
title Purchase Request Workflow — Run and Approval Lifecycle
hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam ArrowColor #326d91
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.3
skinparam titleFontColor #12395b
skinparam titleFontSize 16
skinparam titleFontStyle bold
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #e9f1f6
  BorderColor #1d567d
  FontColor #12395b
  StartColor #176b50
  EndColor #ad3026
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #fff8e7
  BorderColor #c9a227
  FontColor #5a4600
}
skinparam legend {
  BackgroundColor #f4f6f8
  BorderColor #9eabb7
  FontColor #17212b
}

state "Definition candidate" as Candidate
state "Rejected definition\n(no active revision/run)" as Rejected #f3e1dc
state "RUNNING\nREADY" as Ready
state "WAITING_FOR_APPROVAL" as Waiting
state "COMPLETED" as Completed
state "FAILED" as Failed

[*] --> Candidate
Candidate --> Rejected : validation violation
Rejected --> [*]
Candidate --> Ready : revision active + submission accepted

Ready --> Waiting : pending work item + waiting trace committed
Waiting --> Ready : first valid decision + resume cursor committed
Ready --> Completed : handled terminal result committed
Ready --> Failed : unhandled unsuccessful terminal committed

Completed --> [*]
Failed --> [*]

note right of Waiting
No active EventBus subscriber.
State survives restart.
Human decision is never retried.
Identical replay changes nothing;
a conflicting later decision is rejected.
end note

note right of Ready
Cursor state version prevents
concurrent double advancement.
Retry commits an attempt and keeps the cursor READY.
A selected transition advances the cursor.
end note

note bottom of Completed
Business result may be AUTHORIZED,
REJECTED, VALIDATION_FAILED,
or NEEDS_MANUAL_ACTION.
end note

legend
Run state and purchase request business state are separate.
Every transition commits its trace observation in the same unit of work.
endlegend
@enduml
